WIP Project
18+ NSFW Warning

This is an Escape from Tarkov Interface central client.
This client does not interact with the game files or game at all, it just reads what is on screen making it safe from anticheat.
Please refer to Interface Central documentation and set that up before installing this client.

GAME REQUIREMENTS:
Must set resolution (Coming soon)
Must have Health Condition set to "Always Shown" and "polychrome"
